04:26:17.800 --> 04:26:23.610
the same thing. The idea is that you have
one component whose job it is to maintain

04:26:23.610 --> 04:26:30.280
state, and to have the methods that update
state. And then for that component to essentially

04:26:30.280 --> 04:26:36.840
delegate all of the UI logic or presentational
logic to another component. That's called

04:26:36.840 --> 04:26:41.891
the presentational component. That presentational
