react or JavaScript itself. Now one of the
major changes is that our methods can be written

04:58:03.390 --> 04:58:08.280
as arrow functions. And I believe that scrim
that may complain a little bit about this.

04:58:08.280 --> 04:58:12.790
But if you're doing this in your own environment,
